    title "Jury selection for Derek Chauvin murder trial continues - 3/18 (FULL LIVE STREAM)"
    description "The murder trial for Derek Chauvin, the former Minneapolis police officer charged in the death of George Floyd, continues with jury selection on March 18. The judge overseeing the criminal trial dismissed two jurors already seated in the case who heard about the city&#8217;s $27 million settlement with Floyd&#8217;s family. Subscribe to The Washington Post on YouTube: https://wapo.st/2QOdcqK&#10;&#10;Follow us:&#10;Twitter: https://twitter.com/washingtonpost&#10;Instagram: https://www.instagram.com/washingtonpost/&#10;Facebook: https://www.facebook.com/washingtonpost/"
