    title "Derek Chauvin trial continues with defense testimony - 4/14 (FULL LIVE STREAM)"
    description "The trial of Derek Chauvin, the former Minneapolis police officer filmed with his knee on George Floyd&#8217;s neck, continues on April 14. He is charged with murder and manslaughter for Floyd&#8217;s death on May 25, 2020. This stream contains graphic content.&#10;&#10;The twelfth day of the trial saw Chauvin&#8217;s defense launch its case with a focus on George Floyd&#8217;s drug use, as well as testimony from Barry Brodd, a use-of-force expert who described Chauvin&#8217;s actions at the scene as &#8220;justified&#8221; and not &#8220;deadly force.&#8221; Subscribe to The Washington Post on YouTube: https://wapo.st/2QOdcqK&#10;&#10;Follow us:&#10;Twitter: https://twitter.com/washingtonpost&#10;Instagram: https://www.instagram.com/washingtonpost/&#10;Facebook: https://www.facebook.com/washingtonpost/"
