    description "Disturbing new video taken during the last minutes of George Floyd&#8217;s life show onlookers desperately pleading with police to intervene as they stand by, letting Derek Chauvin keep his knee on Floyd&#8217;s neck long after he had stopped moving. The Floyd family lawyer Benjamin Krump released the tape, calling it &#8220;beyond disturbing, even harder to watch that the first video.&#8221; The new video focuses on Officer Tou Thoa, whose casual demeanor infuriates witnesses. #InsideEdition"
