    step 0
    date "2021-05-02T14:30:04Z"
    title "Boskoe100 on Boosie Threatening to Get Derek Chauvin Violated in Prison (Part 6)"
    description "Watch the full interview now, ad-free as a VladTV Youtube Member - https://www.youtube.com/channel/UCg7lal8IC-xPyKfgH4rdUcA/join&#10;&#10;Part 5: https://youtu.be/3uPbpKiRpcw&#10;Part 1: https://youtu.be/HsCVhDb5EYA&#10;--------&#10;In the latest clip, Boskoe100 spoke on Derek Chauvin getting convicted for murdering George Floyd. He expressed a feeling of relief after the verdict was announced and recalled being a kid when the cops who assaulted Rodney King were found not guilty. Boskoe felt Derek Chauvin's conviction was a long-awaited victory for Black and said the police finally seem &#34;touchable.&#34; After Vlad said he witnessed some Black people crying tears of joy, Boskoe added that the trial was way bigger than OJ Simpson's."
