  node [
    id 263
    label "iLUCIDdJgnM"
    step 0
    date "2021-04-08T22:43:40Z"
    title "WATCH LIVE - Derek Chauvin trial: Defense to cross-examine pulmonologist Dr. Martin Tobin"
    description "Pulmonologist Dr. Martin Tobin will re-take the stand Thursday afternoon to be cross-examined by Derek Chauvin's attorney.  Tobin shared his opinion while being questioned by prosecutors that George Floyd died from low oxygen caused by shallow breathing. Tobin testified that lack of oxygen caused damage to Floyd's brain, and his heart to stop. Tobin said he believes Floyd's shallow breathing was caused by prone position, handcuffs behind his back, and knees on the neck and back.&#10;&#10;On Wednesday the defense and prosecution both played police body camera video from Floyd's arrest, but experts on the stand couldn't agree over what Floyd said in the clip. Chauvin's attorney Eric Nelson asserted Floyd said &#34;I ate too many drugs,&#34; while the state insisted he said &#34;I aint do no drugs.&#34;&#10;&#10;https://www.kare11.com/article/news/local/george-floyd/derek-chauvin-trial-day-6-george-floyd-death/89-d542db29-12da-4166-acfe-aadfa5319cc1&#10;&#10;Chauvin faces three charges, second-degree murder, second-degree manslaughter and third-degree murder in the death of George Floyd, who died in police custody in May 2020.&#10;&#10;WARNING: Some of the images depicted in the video and testimony are graphic.&#10;&#10;Have questions about the trial for KARE 11 reporter Lou Raguse? Ask them at @LouRaguse on Twitter, or  Text TRIAL to 763-797-7215. &#10;&#10;Here are the latest case updates for former Minneapolis police officers Derek Chauvin, J. Alexander Kueng, Tou Thao and Thomas Lane, charged in the death of George Floyd: https://www.kare11.com/georgefloyd&#10;&#10;#chauvintrial #georgefloyd #derekchauvin  #drmartintobin&#10;&#8212; &#10;Welcome to the KARE 11 News YouTube channel. Subscribe to our channel for compelling and dramatic storytelling, award winning investigations, breaking news and information you can use. &#10;Text your photos, videos and news tips to 763-797-7215.&#10;&#187; Subscribe to KARE 11 on YouTube: https://www.youtube.com/user/KARE11?s...&#10;&#187; Watch more KARE 11 video: https://www.youtube.com/user/KARE11/v...&#10;&#187; Visit KARE11.com: http://www.kare11.com/&#10;&#187; Download our app! https://www.kare11.com/appredirect&#10;&#187; Find KARE 11 on Facebook: https://www.facebook.com/KARE11/&#10;&#187; Follow KARE 11 on Twitter: https://twitter.com/kare11&#10;&#187; Follow KARE 11 on Instagram: https://www.instagram.com/kare11/"
