    date "2021-04-14T21:05:35Z"
    title "Derek Chauvin Trial: State to cross-examine pathologist on Floyds cause of death"
    description "Prosecutors will cross-examine retired pathologist and former Maryland chief medical examiner Dr. David Fowler, who testified Wednesday that George Floyd died of cardiac arrhythmia, and not from pressure caused by Derek Chauvin's knee. &#10;&#10;&#34;His significant contributing conditions would be, since I've already put the heart disease in part one, he would have the toxicology, fentanyl and methamphetamine,&#34; Fowler told defense attorney Eric Nelson and jurors during questioning. &#34;There is exposure to a vehicle exhaust, potentially carbon monoxide poisoning, increased carbon monoxide in his blood and paraganglioma, or the other natural disease process he has. All of those combined to cause Mr. Floyd's death.&#34;&#10;&#10;Fowler said given the condition of Floyd's heart and the drugs in his system, he would have ruled the manner of death &#34;undetermined.&#34;&#10;&#10;Before the day's testimony began Judge Peter Cahill denied a motion by Derek Chauvin's attorney to drop all charges against the former officer. Eric Nelson asserted that the state has failed to make a case against Chauvin, and asked that his client be acquitted. It is a common request defense attorneys make during the course of a trial.&#10;&#10;Cahill ruled against the motion, and also quashed a subpoena that would have forced reluctant witness Morries Hall to testify, saying he had &#34;a complete fifth amendment privilege here.&#34;&#10;&#10;https://www.kare11.com/article/news/local/george-floyd/derek-chauvin-trial-day-13-george-floyd-death/89-86c74928-c0b2-4d87-b88f-35d420386a3c&#10;&#10;Chauvin faces three charges, second-degree murder, second-degree manslaughter and third-degree murder in the death of George Floyd, who died in police custody in May 2020.&#10;&#10;WARNING: Some of the images depicted in the video and testimony are graphic.&#10;&#10;Have questions about the trial for KARE 11 reporter Lou Raguse? Ask them at @LouRaguse on Twitter, or  Text TRIAL to 763-797-7215. &#10;&#10;Here are the latest case updates for former Minneapolis police officers Derek Chauvin, J. Alexander Kueng, Tou Thao and Thomas Lane, charged in the death of George Floyd: https://www.kare11.com/georgefloyd&#10;&#10;#chauvintrial #georgefloyd #derekchauvin  #philonisefloyd &#10;&#8212; &#10;Welcome to the KARE 11 News YouTube channel. Subscribe to our channel for compelling and dramatic storytelling, award winning investigations, breaking news and information you can use. &#10;Text your photos, videos and news tips to 763-797-7215.&#10;&#187; Subscribe to KARE 11 on YouTube: https://www.youtube.com/user/KARE11?s...&#10;&#187; Watch more KARE 11 video: https://www.youtube.com/user/KARE11/v...&#10;&#187; Visit KARE11.com: http://www.kare11.com/&#10;&#187; Download our app! https://www.kare11.com/appredirect&#10;&#187; Find KARE 11 on Facebook: https://www.facebook.com/KARE11/&#10;&#187; Follow KARE 11 on Twitter: https://twitter.com/kare11&#10;&#187; Follow KARE 11 on Instagram: https://www.instagram.com/kare11/"
    channeltitle "KARE 11"
