    description "Former US police officer Derek Chauvin has been jailed for 22-and-a-half years for murdering George Floyd.&#10;&#10;Chauvin was convicted of second and third degree murder and manslaughter in April after a video showed his knee on the neck of Mr Floyd for more than nine minutes in Minneapolis the following year.&#10;&#10;Read more here:&#10;https://news.sky.com/story/derek-chauvin-former-police-officer-who-murdered-george-floyd-jailed-for-22-and-a-half-years-12341841&#10;&#10;SUBSCRIBE to our YouTube channel for more videos: http://www.youtube.com/skynews&#10; &#10;Follow us on Twitter: https://twitter.com/skynews &#10; &#10;Like us on Facebook: https://www.facebook.com/skynews&#10; &#10;Follow us on Instagram: https://www.instagram.com/skynews&#10; &#10;For more content go to http://news.sky.com and download our apps: &#10; &#10;Apple: https://itunes.apple.com/gb/app/sky-news/id316391924?mt=8&#10; &#10;Android https://play.google.com/store/apps/details?id=com.bskyb.skynews.android&#38;hl=en_GB&#10;&#10;Sky News videos are now available in Spanish here/Los video de Sky News est&#225;n disponibles en espa&#241;ol aqu&#237; https://www.youtube.com/channel/UCzG5BnqHO8oNlrPDW9CYJog"
