    label "vO0UIoNmwWk"
    step 0
    date "2021-04-20T19:48:28Z"
    title "Top Moments From The Derek Chauvin Trial Ahead Of Verdict In George Floyds Death"
    description "Over the course of former Minneapolis police officer Derek Chauvin's 15 day trial, the jury heard from 45 witnesses and were shown footage of bystanders and police during George Floyd&#8217;s last moments. The prosecution and defense presented their closing arguments on Monday and the jury finished deliberations with a verdict imminent. Here is a look back at key moments of the trial.&#10;&#10;Subscribe on YouTube: https://bit.ly/2JjpnIb&#10;&#10;- - - - - - - - - - - - -&#10;&#10;Facebook: https://www.facebook.com/Newsweek&#10;Twitter: https://twitter.com/Newsweek&#10;Instagram: https://www.instagram.com/Newsweek&#10;https://www.newsweek.com"
