    title "Derek Chauvin Trial Witness Donald Williams Tears Up Over His 911 Call About Seeing "
    description "Tuesday marked Donald Williams' second day of testimony in former Minneapolis police officer Derek Chauvin's trial in George Floyd's death. A professional fighter, he's testified that he knew Floyd was in serious trouble and tried to warn officers, but to no avail. He testified that he called 911 on the officers because he believed he was a witness to a &#34;murder.&#34; He was seen tearing up listening to the call playback.&#10;&#10;Subscribe on YouTube: https://bit.ly/2JjpnIb&#10;&#10;- - - - - - - - - - - - -&#10;&#10;Facebook: https://www.facebook.com/Newsweek&#10;Twitter: https://twitter.com/Newsweek&#10;Instagram: https://www.instagram.com/Newsweek&#10;https://www.newsweek.com"
