    date "2021-04-20T22:21:41Z"
    title "Ex-police officer Derek Chauvin found guilty of murdering George Floyd"
    description "Subscribe to our YouTube channel for free here: &#10;https://sc.mp/clipssubscribe&#10;&#10;Derek Chauvin, a former Minneapolis police officer, was found guilty of all charges &#8212;  two counts of murder and one count of manslaughter &#8212; in the death of George Floyd. The jury reached a verdict on April 20, 2021, after a trial that lasted three weeks. Floyd was killed during an arrest by Chauvin and three other officers in May 2020. The video of Floyd pleading &#8220;I can&#8217;t breathe&#8221; as Chauvin knelt on his neck triggered worldwide protests against police brutality and racism. &#10;&#10;Video source: Reuters/Pool&#10;&#10;Read more:&#10;https://www.scmp.com/news/world/united-states-canada/article/3130365/derek-chauvin-found-found-guilty-murder-george&#10;&#10;https://www.scmp.com/news/world/united-states-canada/article/3130388/whats-next-derek-chauvin-after-being-found-guilty&#10;&#10;Support us:&#10;https://subscribe.scmp.com&#10;&#10;Follow us on:&#10;Website:  https://www.scmp.com&#10;Facebook:  https://facebook.com/scmp&#10;Twitter:  https://twitter.com/scmpnews&#10;Instagram:  https://instagram.com/scmpnews&#10;Linkedin:  https://www.linkedin.com/company/south-china-morning-post"
