    title "Day 6 of Derek Chauvin Trial for George Floyds Death | LIVE"
    description "The trial of former Minneapolis police officer Derek Chauvin enters its second week. &#10;&#187; Subscribe to NowThis: http://go.nowth.is/News_Subscribe&#10;&#187; Sign up for our newsletter KnowThis to get the biggest stories of the day delivered straight to your inbox: https://go.nowth.is/KnowThis&#10;&#10;Derek Chauvin faces second-degree murder, third-degree murder, and manslaughter charges in the killing of George Floyd after kneeling on his neck for 9 minutes and 29 seconds in May 2020. During the first week of the trial, footage of Floyd&#8217;s deadly arrest was played for the jury, first hand witnesses got emotional when speaking about the scene they watched unfold, various first responders explained that Floyd showed no sign of life when they arrived at the scene, and a 35-year-veteran of the Minneapolis police department testified that Chauvin&#8217;s use of force was &#8216;totally unnecessary.&#8217;&#10;&#10;For more news and politics, subscribe to NowThis News.&#10;&#10;#DerekChauvin #GeorgeFloyd #BlackLivesMatter #Politics #News #NowThis&#10;&#10;Connect with NowThis&#10;&#187; Like us on Facebook: http://go.nowth.is/News_Facebook&#10;&#187; Tweet us on Twitter: http://go.nowth.is/News_Twitter&#10;&#187; Follow us on Instagram: http://go.nowth.is/News_Instagram&#10;&#187; Find us on Snapchat Discover: http://go.nowth.is/News_Snapchat&#10;&#10;NowThis is your premier news outlet providing you with all the videos you need to stay up to date on all the latest in trending news. From entertainment to politics, to viral videos and breaking news stories, we&#8217;re delivering all you need to know straight to your social feeds. We live where you live.&#10;&#10;http://www.youtube.com/nowthisnews&#10;@nowthisnews"
