    step 0
    date "2022-07-08T20:07:22Z"
    title "Derek Chauvin Did Not Get Maximum Sentence Over George M#rder - Floyds brother"
    description "In entering the plea, Derek chauvin admitted for the first time, he used excessive force when he knelt on George floyd's neck.&#10;He did not offer the floyd family an apology. Instead, he said &#34;he wishes all the best&#34; for Floyd's children.&#10;Mr. chauvin is already serving a 22-and-a-half-year sentence for his conviction on state murder and manslaughter charges at minnesota's only maximum-security prison.&#10;As part of his plea deal, he will be moved to a federal prison which is viewed as being safer.  After the sentencing, George Floyd's brother, Philonise Floyd shared his thoughts on the verdict. &#10;#APC #APCCrisis #AbdullahiAdamu #EkitigovernorshipElection #EkitiElection #IfeanyiOkowa #EkitiState #INEC #apc #apcpresidentalprimaries #2023presidency #PDPPrimaries #2023Elections #DeborahEmmanuel #NnamdiKanu #IPOB #2023Presidency #Russia #Ukraine #UkraineCrisis #RussiaInvadesUkraine #TVCNews #TVC #News #NaijaNews #NaijaGist #Entertainment #NewsUpdate #BreakingNews #NewsInNigeria  #NewsInNigeria #YouTube #Video #TodaysNews #TodaysVideo #NigeriaNews #TrendingGists #YouTube #TrendingVideo #abbakiyari #abbakiyaricase #PresidentBiden #VladmirPutin #TVCNews #NewsUpdate #BabjideKoladeOtitoju #2023Presidency #2023Elections #EkitiGovernorshipElection #APC #JournalistsHangout #TVCNews #NewsUpdate #businessnews #onlinenews #latestnews #todaynews  #2023election #election #2023presidency #latestnews #onlinenews #todaynews #9janews  #NewsUpdate #onlinenews #todaynews #9janews #latestnews #2023Presidency #TVCNews  #NnamdiKanu #ElectoralActAmendmentBil #NnamdiKanu #NewsUpdate #IssuesWithJide #Buhari #YouTube #Video #DailyNews #BreakingNews #IPOB #Biafra #Tinubu #NnamdiKanu #FemiFalana #NigeriaNews #2023Election #TrendingNews #9jaNews #PDP #APC #DailyNews #NewsToday #9jaNews #PoliticsToday #NEDC #Otitoju #BabajideOtitoju #JournalistHangout #BukolaSaraki #Otitoju #GovernorSanwoOlu #NewsNigeria #TrendingVideo #AsiwajuBolaAhmedTinubu #BolaTinubu #BolaAhmedT