    description "Derek Chauvin is expected to plead guilty to federal civil rights charges over his actions leading to George Floyd's murder. &#10;&#10;A federal docket entry shows that a hearing has been scheduled for Wednesday in order for Chauvin to change his current not guilty plea. Chauvin has already been convicted of state murder and manslaughter charges for the murder of George Floyd. &#8220;BNC Live&#8221; host Laverne McGee covers the upcoming trial.  &#10;&#10;All this and more on &#8220;BNC Live.&#8221;   &#10;&#10;To watch BNC programming, visit https://bnc.tv/how-to-watch/     &#10;Follow BNC on social media:     &#10;Facebook: https://www.facebook.com/BNCNews      &#10;Twitter: https://twitter.com/BNCNews      &#10;Instagram: https://www.instagram.com/bncnews/?hl=en    &#10;&#10;#DerekChauvin #CivilRightsCharges #GeorgeFloyd"
