    date "2021-03-30T18:20:07Z"
    title "Derek Chauvin Trial: Witnesses testify about death of George Floyd"
    description "The second day of the former Minneapolis police officer Derek Chauvin's trial resumed Tuesday with multiple witnesses testifying. The first witnesses, a mixed martial artist, was one of the people outside of the Cup Foods where Chauvin kneeled on George Floyd's neck. He is the second witness to testify that he called the police on the police officers involved in Floyd's death. The next witness was the teenager who recorded the video that has since gone viral. Multiple witnesses that followed were not shown on camera due to their age, including a nine-year-old who took the stand. BNC Chief Legal Correspondent Dr. Laura McNeal spoke on DC Today about the case live from Minneapolis with details about the testimony. &#10;&#10;For more information about the trial, visit https://bnc.tv/derek-chauvin-trial-live-updates-multiple-witnesses-minors-testify-in-court/&#10;&#10;#BNC #DCToday #DerekChauvinTrial"
