    step 0
    date "2021-04-20T21:42:48Z"
    title "Charles Blow reacts to guilty verdict in Derek Chauvin trial"
    description "On Tuesday, the jury reached a verdict in the trial of former Minneapolis Police officer Derek Chauvin. The jurors found him guilty of second-degree murder, second-degree manslaughter, and third-degree murder. BNC host Charles Blow said the moment is historic. &#34;He is now in custody convicted for the murder of George Floyd,&#34; he said. &#34;I am really hoping some members of this jury will go public and tell us their thinking,&#34; he said. While he understands that the prosecution displayed a great case, Blow also said that he thinks some jurors were motivated by the video. &#10; &#10;For live updates of the verdict, visit https://bnc.tv/derek-chauvin-verdict-jury-finds-the-former-officer-guilty-on-all-counts/&#10;&#10;To watch BNC's gavel-to-gavel coverage, visit https://bnc.tv/how-to-watch/&#10;&#10;#BNC #GeorgeFloyd #DerekChauvinTrial"
