    title "The craziest videos of the week: Matt Gaetz, Iceland volcano, Derek Chauvin trial"
    description "t&#8217;s been another wild week and Daily Mail has the videos to prove it!&#10;&#10;This week, the Derek Chauvin trial continues, a man in India was a hero after he saved fellow bank queuer from falling head-first over a balcony, a bus driver in Virginia got the shock of his life when a deer smashed through his windshield, and a Florida man got away with it after a 90lb fish nearly smashed him in the face!&#10;&#10;Elsewhere, UK Prime Minister Boris Johnson drew a very odd-looking banana on a visit to a London school, an Icelandic volcano continues to erupt near Reikjavik, while the Ever Given ship was finally freed from the Suez Canal. &#10;&#10;All this and more right here:&#10;&#10;0:00 Intro&#10;0:11 Hero bystander saves man in India from falling off balcony&#10;0:53 Moment deer bolts through school bus windshield&#10;1:32 Trucker jailed after going wrong way down motorway&#10;1:47 Icelandic volcano that had been dormant for over 6,000 years continues to erupt&#10;2:27 Matt Gaetz claims sex allegations are part of $25million extortion plot&#10;3:43 Moment neo-Nazi Met Police officer is arrested&#10;4:00 High school teacher chains herself to court where Derek Chauvin is standing trial&#10;4:42 Derek Chauvin George Floyd murder trial: EMT told off by judge for arguing&#10;5:43 Once-stunning Bolivian lake left in ruins by plastic pollution&#10;6:16 Ship blocking Suez Canal finally dislodged and set free&#10;6:56 Taiwan train crash: dozens are killed and others remain trapped&#10;7:35 Fisherman narrowly avoids being slapped in the face by a 90lbs fish&#10;8:05 Moment man discovers giant porcupine standing in his kitchen&#10;8:37 World Landmarks turn lights off to mark Earth Hour&#10;9:42 UK Prime Minister Boris Johnson draws oddly-shaped banana&#10;10:39 Elephants stuck in a ditch team up to get out&#10;&#10;&#10;Daily Mail Website: https://www.dailymail.co.uk&#10;Daily Mail Facebook: https://facebook.com/dailymail&#10;Daily Mail IG: https://instagram.com/dailymail&#10;Daily Mail Snap: https://snapchat.com/discover/Daily-Ma...&#10;Daily Mail Twitter: https://twitter.com/MailOnline&#10;&#10;Daily Mail Pinterest: https://pinterest.co.uk/dailymail&#10; &#10;Get the free Daily Mail mobile app: https://dailymail.co.uk/mobile"
