    description "The experienced criminal attorney, George Tragos, hosts today's video and gets listeners up to date on the Derek Chauvin Trial.   &#10;&#10;In this video, Mr. Tragos answers listener questions like &#34;is there a blue wall&#34;, &#34;what is our prediction&#34;, &#34;why are violent videos like this allowed on social media&#34;, and much more. &#10;&#10;If you have more questions about this topic, please leave them below &#38; we will try to get to them asap!&#10;&#10;George Floyd was killed on 25 May 2020 in Minneapolis. His death prompted a worldwide protest.&#10;Legal Analysis&#10;&#10;&#10;#lawyeryouknow&#8203;&#8203;&#8203;&#8203;&#8203; #georgefloyd&#8203;&#8203;&#8203;&#8203;&#8203; #derekchauvin&#10;&#10;&#128308; Subscribe for more free YouTube tips:&#10; https://www.youtube.com/channel/UCxAH...&#8203;...&#10;&#10;Share this video with a YouTuber friend:&#10;https://youtu.be/LFZT2_lZNbE&#10;&#10;&#9989; For business inquiries contact me at lawyeryouknow@gmail.com&#10;&#9989; Let's connect: www.tragoslaw.com&#10;&#10;Twitter - @tragoslaw&#10;Instagram - /tragoslaw&#10;Facebook - /tragoslaw&#10;TikTok - /tragoslaw&#10;&#10;&#128308; Watch next &#8211; https://youtu.be/kysHZUhQfA4&#8203;&#8203;&#8203;&#8203;&#8203;&#10;&#10;&#128308; Recommended Playlist &#8211; https://www.youtube.com/playlist?list...&#8203;...&#10;&#10;NOT LEGAL ADVICE&#10;&#10; https://www.tragoslaw.com/clearwater-criminal/"
