    description "Many wonder whether Derek Chauvin will testify in his defense in the on-going trial regarding the charges leveled against him in connection to the death of George Floyd.&#10;However, the jury already got to hear Derek Chauvin give his own explanation about why he did what he did.  He is responding to a question from bystander Charles McMillian.&#10;&#10;You can watch the trial live on my channel, Mentour Lawyer.  Or you can watch the speedy replay later in the night - called &#34;Speedy Trial&#34; - also on my channel:  Mentour Lawyer.&#10;&#10;The Trial of Derek Chauvin, 44, the fired Minneapolis police officer charged in the alleged May 25, 2020 murder or wrongful death of George Floyd, 46, started during the last week of March. &#10;&#10;The question before jurors is whether this constituted second-degree murder,  second-degree manslaughter, third-degree murder, or whether Chauvin is innocent of all charges.&#10;&#10;#DerekChauvin #GeorgeFloyd #MentourLawyer #truecrime&#10;&#10;Derek Chauvin Trial Live Stream&#10;Derek Chauvin Trial Live Coverage&#10;Watch Live Derek Chauvin Trial&#10;George Floyd Trial live&#10;&#10;You can support the channel through Patreon here:  https://www.patreon.com/user?u=35458155&#10;Or via PayPal here https://www.paypal.com/cgi-bin/webscr?cmd=_s-xclick&#38;hosted_button_id=BU42K8UV9XRE8&#38;source=url&#10;Or, during the premier, by doing a Super Chat"
